Can I take a peek down there please?

854
01:01:22,596 --> 01:01:23,430
- We're closing.

855
01:01:23,431 --> 01:01:24,472
- You want me to leave?

856
01:01:24,473 --> 01:01:25,807
- Yes, right now.

857
01:01:25,808 --> 01:01:27,267
- All right.

858
01:01:27,268 --> 01:01:28,268
All right.

859
