952
01:06:39,496 --> 01:06:40,788
Wash his mouth out with soap.

953
01:06:40,789 --> 01:06:42,540
Now you sit down.

954
01:06:42,541 --> 01:06:44,500
Say uncle!

955
01:06:44,501 --> 01:06:45,335
"Uncle!"

956
01:06:45,335 --> 01:06:46,335
