1028
01:10:54,418 --> 01:10:55,418
Don't be alarmed.

1029
01:10:57,003 --> 01:10:58,587
Welcome to Salem's Lot.

1030
01:10:58,588 --> 01:11:01,799
I'm Judge Axel, and
there's been an accident.

1031
01:11:01,800 --> 01:11:03,342
Unfortunately, I'm going to have

1032
