you to look at this.

1042
01:11:50,682 --> 01:11:52,850
- No, let him look.

1043
01:11:52,851 --> 01:11:53,894
Let him look.

1044
01:12:27,385 --> 01:12:30,221
- They sleep in the
basement of their homes.

1045
01:12:30,222 --> 01:12:31,264
- Not the children.

1046
